3.stable.official [77dcf97d8]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.dev3 - Linux Mint 22 (Wilma) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 (nvidia; 550.107.02) - AMD FX(tm)-6300 Six-Core Processor (6 threads), also tested in Windows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen the display scale is set to a value less than 100%, the Customize Run Instances window will open with its minimum possible size.\r\n\r\nThis is what it looks like with a display scale of 75%:\r\n\r\n![Screenshot from 2024-10-25 19-23-19](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/53632d03-f8fa-4bd0-b039-08c272bb07f6)\r\n\r\nThis is what it looks like with the display scale set to 100%:\r\n\r\n![Screenshot from 2024-10-25 19-24-09](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1fcae66d-8e37-40b6-bfd6-57bf3707a79c)\r\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Go to Editor > Editor Settings and set Display Scale to 75%\r\n2. Click Debug > Customize Run Instances\r\n3. The window will open at the minimum possible size\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_t